ES:
Quiero una taza de café.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} y échale {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tres azucarillos{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
figura.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hey, yo, this isn't, ya know, the
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}blend{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} I wanted...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It ain't a big deal, though.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Don't worry 'bout it, kid.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's still a good cup o' java.
I gotta get going.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} See ya 'round, pal!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ehi, ma questo non è il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}caffè lungo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
che ho ordinato...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, non fa niente.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Non preoccuparti, ragazzin{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non è poi così male, tutto sommato.
Oh, devo andare.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ci si vede in giro!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hey, bu istediğim harman{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
değil...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Ama büyütülecek şey{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
değil. Dert etme{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} evlat; yine de
iyi kahve. Ben kaçayım{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}.
Görüşürüz!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Mh, ma senti un po'...
Ci hai messo il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}latte{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} nel caffè?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, niente di grave comunque.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Va bene anche così. Ma sì, davvero,
non ti preoccupare.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È buono lo stesso.
Beh, torno alle mie gallerie.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ci si vede in giro!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hey, buddy, there ain't enough
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}sugar{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} in here, ya know?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nothin' to lose sleep over, though.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
This is OK. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Believe me, I've survived
worse things than strong coffee.
Time to hit the tunnels again.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
See ya 'round, pal!
